        "TALCO in a Glance",
        "TALCO has launched its business in 1976 as a Fabricator to manufacture doors, windows and kitchen cabinets",
        "",
        "\t\t",
        "",
        "\t\t\t\t",
        "",
        "\t\t\t\t\t",
