        "",
        "\t\t\t\t",
        "",
        "\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
        "According to integrated professional workflow with a comprehensive development strategy, adopting research and study of the market and the growing needs of customers, expanding the work channels within the company in 1983, covering the manufacture and production of aluminium profiles that enter the business. This gave the company sufficient flexibility and efficiency to invest in the latest equipment and advanced technical programs; to achieve a distinguished achievement represented in the introduction of the first commercial line for using the powder of coating in the KSA. It motivated the company to expand its scope of business to include the import of advanced European technologies capable of producing distinguished products and providing them to all customers in the Arab Gulf region. ",
