        "\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
        "Stemming from its eagerness to support its customers with an integrated range of distinguished products, delivery services and solutions, “TALCO” has developed an advanced packaging system, which aims to carry out the operations of loading, handling and unloading containers of products with precision and great care to protect it during handling and shipping to 40 states in the world, including the Gulf Cooperation Council countries, the Arab world, East Asian states, Australia, the United States of America and Europe.",
